                                "sense_id": "6bcf1f57-822f-3859-b1d5-e54daf9c7277",
                                "text": "In popular language Feeling is not always synonymous with State of Consciousness; being often taken more peculiarly for those states which are conceived as belonging to the sensitive, or to the emotional, phasis of our nature […]."
